cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "heav3ns-censor: Deterministic Zero-Collateral Localized Image Obscuration with Multi-Scale Frequency-Domain & JPEG-Quantization Resilience Verification"
message: "If you use heav3ns-censor or its mathematical SDF compositing and multi-scale verification algorithms in your research or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
